      ],
      "content": "Do",
      "line_start": 13,
      "line_end": 13,
      "truncated": false
    },
    {
      "source_uri": "file:///Users/scemac/My_github/Aegis/knowledge/techniques/cards/rev-constant-permutation-table.md",
      "source_kind": "local_document",
      "verified": false,
      "action_policy": "none",
      "source_digest": "sha256:706a4497cb403b2b179af6936ca345e7069458cd13f13096633078fa97841c6f",
      "compiler_version": "1.0.0",
      "kind": "list",
      "topic": "常量表 / 置换表反推",
      "section": [
        "常量表 / 置换表反推",
        "Do"
      ],
      "content": "1. 在 __const/.rodata/__TEXT 中找连续且每 n 个一组、元素恰为 0..n-1 的序列。\n2. 对每组计算字典序/Lehmer 排名得到索引；索引可能取模或加常数映射到字节。\n3. 用可打印字符/常见 flag 格式过滤候选。\n4. 把候选重新编码回置换表，确认与原表一致。",
      "line_start": 14,
      "line_end": 17,
      "truncated": false
    },
